    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "No, but I’ve heard of tools like Wolfram Alpha for quick calculations. Since my conscientiousness is moderate and extraversion is balanced, I’d probably use it cautiously—only when stuck on a problem that’s too complex for me to solve alone.",
